be&#x017F;tellte ich, was ich zu e&#x017F;&#x017F;en befahl, &#x017F;ondern riß<lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">F 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">bei</fw><lb/>
<pb n="86" facs="#f0090"/>
